        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rules-note" value="Accounting invariant&#xa;&#xa;Reserve a conservative upper bound.&#xa;Trusted actual usage REPLACES the hold.&#xa;Reported cache subsets use their pinned prices.&#xa;Unknown usage retains conservative liability.&#xa;Provider TPM / RPM limits remain independent." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#c69b42;fontColor=#5b4717;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;align=left;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
