        <mxCell id="legend" value="BLUE: request / accounting   GREEN: shared state   PURPLE dashed: portal   GRAY dotted: telemetry / read-only observation&#xa;Responses return along the same route. Stream-to-Engine is an in-process call, NOT an HTTP call to the control Function." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#52657a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
